  "texts": {
    "preamble": "R.Kodikesavan vs State Through on 4 December, 2024 Author: N.Anand Venkatesh Bench: N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P.(MD)No.1 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 04.12.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P.(MD)No.14617 of 2022 and Crl.M.P.(MD) No.9473 of 2022 1.R.Kodikesavan 2.P. Rajan ... Pe Vs. 1.State through, The Food Safety Officer, Thoothukudi Corporation Zone - Ii, Thoothukudi District. 2.Kalimuthu (Age not known), (Father's name not known) Code No. 596, Zone Ii, Food Safety Officer, Thoothukudi Corporation, Thoothukudi District. ... Respo PRAYER : Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 4 Criminal Procedure Code, to call for the records in C.C.No. 195 of pending before the learned Judicial Magistrate No. II, Thoothukudi quash the same. For Petitioners : Mr.KA.Ramakrishnan For Respondents : Mr.S.Ravi Additional Public Prosecutor 1/5 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis Crl.O.P.(MD)No. R.Kodikesavan vs State Through on 4 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/88906526/ 1 ORDER",
    "facts": "This petition has been filed challenging the proceedings initiated by the respondents against the petitioners under Section 3(1)(zx) and Section 3(1)(zz)(v)(vii) and (xi) and Section 26(1)(2)(i)(ii) and (v) read with 51, 59(i) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
